WEBVTT

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.160
In preparation for our
match with Team Psykick

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:41.030
The BBA team all got together
again for the first time in ages.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:52.800
We became a little closer
to mastering the MG Core,

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.960
created by Miss Judy, Max's mom.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.760
We're all ready to go.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:07.770
On the day of the match,
in the bus headed to the arena,

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.400
We all began to slowly
lose consciousness.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:39.130
Huh?

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.390
Where are we?

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:44.390
Weren't we on the bus?

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.890
Where is this?

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.730
What is this?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.900
What? I can't take it off...

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:58.700
Neither can I.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.210
When did this...?

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.280
Who did this?

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:09.500
Takao! This is bad!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:10.620
Takao!

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.630
Are we there yet?

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.420
Stop sleeping!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.670
Get up!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.630
Where is this?

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:23.590
Someone kidnapped us!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:25.430
While we were sleeping!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:27.060
Look at this.

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:28.640
What the heck is this?

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:31.230
It won't come off...

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.160
We can't take it off.

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:38.480
You all, too...

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.960
What's going on here?

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.950
Good morning.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.200
How do you feel now
that you've awoken, kids?

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.700
Who are you?!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.950
I hope you all slept well.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.540
With the help of the
sleeping gas, that is.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.500
Sleeping gas?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.500
That bus was booby trapped?

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:57.340
This isn't funny!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:04:00.130
We've got an important
match to get to!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.760
I don't know who you are but we
don't have time for your games!

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:08.060
Do not worry!
This is your arena.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:09.100
--Huh?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:10.890
That's not what
we agreed to!

00:04:10.890 --> 00:04:13.390
He's totally lying, Max.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.590
Ignore him.
Let's get moving.

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:17.650
Going?

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.360
Do you think
you can escape?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:24.070
Shut your mouth!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.290
Suck on that!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.080
Why'd you break it?

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.620
I was going to ask
him to take this off!

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.550
Takao, I remember
hearing that voice before!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:43.060
The opponents we were
supposed to face today...

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.720
Team Psykick?!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:50.180
Welcome to our battle arena!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:56.100
We'll be sure to closely observe the
championship-winning BBA team.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.270
I don't like this!

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:01.360
Why do we have
to listen to you?

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.900
Staying in hiding
like a buncha creeps!

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:06.780
If you wanna talk
then do it face to face!

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.370
If you won't come to us,
we'll come to you!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.700
Fine.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.850
I don't think you know
where we are, though.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.040
Damn!

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.000
Above!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.470
Where... Are we?

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:30.100
Who knows...? I don't
have the slightest idea.

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:37.310
You will now battle one-on-one with
four of our proud Team Psykick members.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.770
I hope you're ready.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.540
Wait!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:44.610
We were headed to the arena
to accept your challenge!

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.860
Why don't you just fight
us fair and square there?

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.320
Why do you need to stoop so low?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.700
He's right! This is
just a sneak attack!

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.790
Be quiet!

00:05:55.010 --> 00:05:56.930
We won't be quiet!

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:59.710
And what are
these ugly bracelets?

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.340
Take them off right now!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:07.010
We'll remove them when you
beat all four Psykick members.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.570
What?!

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:13.100
For the record, each bracelet
has a tracking device inside of it.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:19.270
We'll be watching
your every move.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.860
There's nowhere to run.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.360
You have to fight.

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:27.740
Screw you! Don't talk
like you control us!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:29.780
Show yourself, you creep!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:31.870
What happened?

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.000
The match was supposed
to be right here.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:41.670
There isn't any sort of
match planned for today.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.920
That can't be.

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.460
And more importantly,
where is everyone?

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:51.190
The BBA team should have
arrived by bus already.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:56.270
Just to be sure, I tried calling the
phone number here on the business card,

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.770
but it's not in service.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.610
Then...

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:01.730
What of Kinomiya
and his friends...?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.330
This is horrible!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.650
Where has the BBA
team run off to?

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:11.780
This is their doing.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.090
"Their"?

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:15.130
Those damn scientists?

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:17.870
Damn! They just had to butt in!

00:07:17.870 --> 00:07:19.500
Relax, Dunga.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:23.500
I know they're after the
Sacred Beasts, just like we are.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:27.130
But can they take them?

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.170
From those guys...

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:31.090
What should we do, Takao?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.220
Why don't we just
leave this forest?

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:35.720
You're right!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:38.520
They're after your Sacred Beasts.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.560
You should avoid
battling if you can.

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.410
There should be a
way we came in from!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:46.900
So all that training
was for nothing.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.280
Honestly...

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:50.900
They're rough for a team of Bladers.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.530
If you're not going to fight,

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.700
We have no use for you.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.120
Too bad. Time to disappear.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.140
Disappear?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.710
These facilities will
explode in three minutes.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:07.630
What?!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.090
Takao!

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.100
That's a laugh! Just try me!

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:13.510
Betcha can't!

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.220
Ha! Nyah-nyah!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.310
Prepare to destroy system 135.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:19.930
Sir.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.770
This should get them to buy it.

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.370
They're serious!
We can't stay here!

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:38.830
Let's move!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.300
Dang, are they for real?

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:44.250
Takao, this is all because
you egged them on!

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.120
What?!

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:47.080
Now's not the time for this!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.550
Targets are moving to point KQ-9.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.670
Measuring motion data.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:56.680
Fools. They should have
just accepted the battle.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:59.220
Move to system 507.

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.010
--Sir!

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.520
Now, can they find the exit?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.560
Why won't it open?

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.610
Open up! Let us out!

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:13.530
Are they gonna kill us?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.570
This way's out too.
It's all just iron wall!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.200
Nope. There aren't
any exits anywhere!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.410
One minute left!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.250
Takao!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.840
You okay?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.010
Ouch...

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:39.970
It's a minecart!

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.060
Get down here guys!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.470
We're gonna escape on this!

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:47.480
What's this?

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:50.150
I didn't think there'd be
an underground path.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.940
Let's get on!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.150
I wonder where this leads to?

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:57.240
Who cares? We need
to get out of here!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:59.660
It's going to explode in 20 seconds!

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:03.620
You're good! Get on!

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:10.080
Wait!

00:10:11.250 --> 00:10:12.750
What're you doing?!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.460
Five seconds!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:17.050
Three... two...

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.340
Get down!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.390
They're gone!

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.520
Bro, did they--

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.230
What happened?

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.710
All according to plan.

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:35.940
Targets, moved to point L3-3.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:39.280
We wouldn't harm our
special guests, would we?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.740
When's the first battle?

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:45.200
Mr. Gideon!

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:48.620
Soon. Wait just a moment, sir.

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:55.340
The time has come for us to
obtain the four Sacred Beasts.

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.140
Where are we going?

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.430
Don't ask me!
Ask this thing!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:09.310
I feel like we're speeding
up. Is that just me?

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:12.100
No, it's quite possible that--

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:30.500
Someone hit the brakes!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.500
It won't budge!

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.550
It's rusted! Shoot!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:38.550
The rails are split!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:41.260
We'll get derailed!

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.340
We're gonna crash!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.840
Dranzer!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.260
Go!

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:54.560
Ya did it, Kai!

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:56.040
That was close!

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:58.150
I see light! It's the
end of the tunnel!

00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.280
Thank goodness...

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.400
Hey, is the rail cut off?

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.370
What?!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:16.000
We're alive...

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.270
Where are we?

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:20.130
It looks like a field...

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:25.840
A stadium.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.810
What's it doing here?

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.870
Well? Do you feel
like battling now?

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:37.020
Damn! I feel like you're
still making fun of us!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.860
System 204.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.530
Sacred Beast capture
system is at the ready.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:45.570
Now, who will be
the first to battle?

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.660
Rei? Kai? Max?

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.700
Or Takao Kinomiya...?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:53.540
This is perfect! I'll fight you!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:54.620
--Takao!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.610
I knew it'd be you.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:00.170
Where's the guy who
wants a piece of me?

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.260
Come on out!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:03.670
He's right in front of you.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.720
Let me introduce him.
This is Chameleon!

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.930
What a creep!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.270
You, huh?

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:16.060
Stop this, Takao.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.690
Why should I, Kyoujyu?

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.570
If I don't beat him
we can't leave this forest!

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:24.570
There's no proof that
they'll keep to their word!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.820
And it's dangerous!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.200
It'll be fine!

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.560
Did you forget, Takao?

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:32.540
The Psykicks are after
your Sacred Beasts!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.540
Who knows what could happen to your
Sacred Beast if you battle needlessly...!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.130
I'm getting way too
many bad signals here.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.710
I agree. I don't think we
should take their bait.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.340
Then what do we--

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.800
We're getting out of here!

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:48.840
Lemme go!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.640
Rei! Kai!

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:53.440
I said let me go!

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.930
We need to think
of a way out of here.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.980
But as long as we have
these things on us...

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.270
No, there has to be a way.

00:14:01.270 --> 00:14:04.070
Yeah! We can't give up yet!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:07.610
Targets are now in point M4-6.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:10.780
Destroy system 214.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.250
This way!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.130
Max!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:25.630
Stay outta this.
He's my catch.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:27.130
Catch?!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:29.720
Takao!

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.390
Cut that thing down, Dragoon!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.060
What?!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.020
Target B has been captured!

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:45.980
Good. Have them battle at stadium G-8.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.030
A stadium?

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.990
Max!

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:57.960
What is this junk?

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.580
Quicksand?!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.130
Max!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.800
Time for the first round.

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.410
Do it, Chameleon.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:11.550
Now... Bring it on!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:14.350
Well, Max Mizuhara?

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:17.020
Get Draciel ready.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.610
I don't have a choice.
I'm going to fight!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.570
Max...

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.820
Yeah! Go get 'em Max!

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.280
Beat that guy's ugly mug!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:32.410
If they're going to fight...

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.540
Go Shoot!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.540
Go, Chameleon!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.790
That's it! Keep on him, Draciel!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:46.090
Keep it up, Max!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:48.420
Is that all you got?

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.800
What?!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.130
Chameleon!

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:55.550
It vanished!

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.720
No, it's camouflage!

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:02.020
His Bey is spinning so fast that its
colors become one with the environment!

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:05.230
It only looks like
it disappeared.

00:16:05.770 --> 00:16:07.150
Camouflage?

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.360
No...!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.280
Heads up, Max!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:18.290
Don't count me out!
I'm just getting warmed up!

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:21.580
Yes, that's it.
Release your Sacred Beast.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.500
Attack him, Chameleon!

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.210
Darn it...

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:32.840
Like that!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.470
He's got a read on him!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:39.600
Draciel's own high rotation speed
canceled out the camouflage!

00:16:39.600 --> 00:16:41.140
Look at that!

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:43.200
Keep it up, Max!

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.770
Alright... Come at me
however you like.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.980
You're sorely mistaken
if you think this is over!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.820
What are those movements?

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.320
It's the magnetic force!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:58.830
I knew it! Chameleon has some of
that unknown material in his Bey, too!

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.410
Max! Don't forget
what we trained for!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:03.960
The MG Core... That's it!

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.920
We mastered it, didn't we?

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.670
The MG Core that my mom
worked so hard to develop...

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.970
It's time to show you
how much we've trained!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.100
Go, Draciel!

00:17:24.850 --> 00:17:27.850
You think you're a
match for our Magtram?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:33.690
Shoot... What strong
magnetic force!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.830
It's an incredibly
powerful magnetic wave!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:42.290
If he can fight toe-to-toe with
Draciel, he must be a fearsome opponent...

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.330
Draciel's lagging behind!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:50.710
He still doesn't have perfect
control over the MG Core...

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.380
That, combined with
his surprise attacks...

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.380
Max! You better not lose!

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:57.880
You gotta hang in there, Draciel!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:00.890
What?!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.890
Max!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.390
He has to use his Sacred Beast.

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.950
Fight him back with
your Sacred Beast, Max!

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:11.190
He shouldn't. There are strange
devices scattered all around the stadium.

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:13.980
If he summons his Sacred Beast,
who knows what could happen?

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:16.030
Are you saying he
should just pack it in?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.280
He's slowing down, too.

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:20.490
Now's the time to attack!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.490
Status on the Sacred
Beast capture system?

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.600
All ready, sir.

00:18:25.600 --> 00:18:27.160
Bro...

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:29.250
I know he'll bring it out.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.420
Chameleon... just a little more...

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:36.630
Go, Chameleon! Finish him off!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.380
I can't lose now...

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.970
This is for my team!

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.480
Go, Genbu!

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:00.280
Yes!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:02.490
Bro!

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.780
What is this?

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.950
Now! Activate the Sacred
Beast capture system!

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.960
Genbu... is it?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:21.760
What is that?!

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:33.860
What?!

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:38.820
Unbelievable... They're
stronger than our capture devices?!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:44.490
Now, Draciel! Blow him away!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.210
I did it!

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.130
Yay!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:54.750
You did it!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.670
Been a while since
I saw you fight!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.460
Genbu overpowered the opponent!

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:04.090
I didn't think the Sacred
Beasts would be this powerful...

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:07.420
Bro, what're we gonna do now?

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.180
Quiet! It's just the first one!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.770
Right.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:15.700
I will get the remaining three
Sacred Beasts no matter what.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:19.480
Move on to the next plan, Doctor.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:22.380
Understood, Mr. Gideon.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.990
Activate system 502!

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:25.990
Roger that!

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.660
Aww man, now I wanna battle!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:31.960
Where's the next opponent?

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.170
We don't have to
waste time battling.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:36.880
You're so simple-minded.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.630
What?!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.970
Look! It might be a clearing in the forest!

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.430
Oh, yeah!

00:20:46.090 --> 00:20:46.800
Huh?

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:57.020
Takao!

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.440
Gimme a hand...

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.150
I sprained my leg!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:03.820
The ocean!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:07.870
Listen up, kids.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.490
I thought I said escaping was pointless.

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.160
This is a remote island in the south.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.770
This is an island?!

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.210
You're kidding!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.710
Then what will we...?

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.630
The next battle will be in
a cave, deep within the forest.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:24.840
We'll be waiting.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.430
Damn!

00:22:59.060 --> 00:23:04.770
We've been kidnapped to an island completely surrounded by water.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:09.700
While we try to find a way out, Psykick challenges us to cheap battles.

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:12.990
Chairman Daitenji! Hurry up and save us!

00:23:12.990 --> 00:23:16.670
Huh? You can't hear us from so far away?

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.200
You heard that, didn't you?

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:21.080
Don't miss the next episode!
